@page
@model AboutModel
@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "About";
}

<div class="card">
    <h1>About</h1>
    <p>
        This is a prototype web app for an online AI SAT teacher: it generates lesson scripts,
        explains solutions, and lets students take original practice exams.
    </p>
    <p class="muted">
        Disclaimer: This app is not affiliated with the College Board. All included practice questions are original.
    </p>

    <h2>AI setup</h2>
    <p>Defaults to Stub mode. To enable OpenAI:</p>
    <pre><code>Ai__Provider=OpenAI
Ai__OpenAi__ApiKey=YOUR_KEY
Ai__OpenAi__Model=gpt-5.2
Ai__OpenAi__TtsModel=tts-1
Ai__OpenAi__TtsVoice=alloy</code></pre>

    <h2>“Video” generation</h2>
    <p>
        Videos are implemented as “video jobs” built from scripts. If OpenAI is enabled, the app generates narration audio (OpenAI TTS)
        and synchronizes the whiteboard writing to that narration.
        You can click “Save video” to export a real WebM file.
    </p>
</div>
